    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "This function creates a sparse matrix object that is stored in pointwise format and is ready to receive values from the various insert routines.",
      "ko": "This function creates a sparse matrix object that is stored in pointwise format and is ready to receive values from the various insert routines.",
      "sourceHash": "73479b7186b054f14978e1ebffb3806281c7fc5e108724efdca2f104bdf4166b",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Pointwise format means individual values are stored for a given `i,j` location as opposed to blocks of values.",
      "ko": "Pointwise 형식은 `i,j` 위치에 대해 개별 값이 값 블록이 아닌 형태로 저장됨을 의미합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4a91d5305655c87ee9c4032a6f592a5b5c24c86a39a8c0df0c8914c461deb89c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "For block support use the block create routines.",
      "ko": "블록 지원은 블록 생성 루틴을 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "212892cd31020f6a724acbf51bf65b517a47eb43f37e0808f0a0e17959204544",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0004",
      "source": "See the various insert routines for details on inserting entries into this matrix object.",
      "ko": "이 행렬 객체에 항목을 삽입하는 자세한 내용은 다양한 삽입 루틴을 참조합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f36b9261740b3702a20771cc47267d22f0a215129542ded9bdc3e4235df206fa",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "After you’ve finished with the matrix, it’s important that you free the memory allocated to it with [`sparse_matrix_destroy(_:)`](sparse_matrix_destroy(_:).md).",
      "ko": "행렬 사용이 끝나면 [`sparse_matrix_destroy(_:)`](sparse_matrix_destroy(_:).md)를 사용해 행렬에 할당된 메모리를 해제해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4260916c505668d80e80182441011f164f0ac522d0524267cb4bba8b4610e58f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "❗ **Important**: Apple provides the BLAS and LAPACK libraries under the Accelerate framework to be in line with LAPACK 3.9.1.",
      "ko": "❗ **중요**: Apple은 Accelerate 프레임워크에서 BLAS 및 LAPACK 라이브러리를 LAPACK 3.9.1과 일치하도록 제공합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a77369ab1a513f75d549e2a2b5f235354e7fe9eb179d30112cb5b875a0da3ca1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0002",
      "source": "Starting with iOS 26, iPadOS 26, macOS 26, tvOS 26, visionOS 26, and watchOS 26, the libraries are in line with LAPACK 3.12.0.",
      "ko": "iOS 26, iPadOS 26, macOS 26, tvOS 26, visionOS 26, watchOS 26부터 라이브러리는 LAPACK 3.12.0과 일치합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e97eae73b60b46857199b3a97c28a7fe190ea650310acb446b972c4028f031ba",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0003",
      "source": "These new interfaces provide additional functionality, as well as a new ILP64 interface.",
      "ko": "이 새 인터페이스는 추가 기능과 함께 새 ILP64 인터페이스도 제공합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "0dc3eddf285da2e9fa8eeff1e0a16a3aa28c6605b012d1a7576852840eec7412",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0004",
      "source": "To use the new interfaces, define `ACCELERATE_NEW_LAPACK` before including the Accelerate or vecLib headers.",
      "ko": "새 인터페이스를 사용하려면 Accelerate 또는 vecLib 헤더를 포함하기 전에 `ACCELERATE_NEW_LAPACK`을 정의합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d4c90cb9ef138f9dba90b86be8520319ce986b8a1da37bf533614d2f6465326b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0005",
      "source": "For ILP64 interfaces, also define `ACCELERATE_LAPACK_ILP64`.",
      "ko": "ILP64 인터페이스의 경우 `ACCELERATE_LAPACK_ILP64`도 정의합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7649752f08ef6fac723ac25bcf97bdb73433ac54a80c54458d0c86dce09414b3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0006",
      "source": "For Swift projects, specify `ACCELERATE_NEW_LAPACK=1` and `ACCELERATE_LAPACK_ILP64=1` as preprocessor macros in Xcode build settings.",
      "ko": "Swift 프로젝트의 경우 Xcode 빌드 설정에서 `ACCELERATE_NEW_LAPACK=1` 및 `ACCELERATE_LAPACK_ILP64=1`을 전처리기 매크로로 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "91cb6773e72581ad6c7100f2f5abd4987cf89797f2a3c344059d4b6c9a66ba0b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
